    "title": "March Madness bracket 2026, full NCAA Tournament first round schedule",
    "text": "Updated March 15, 2026, 8:11 p.m. CTThe 2026 NCAA Tournament bracket will be revealed on Selection Sunday.March Madness begins with the First Four games on March 17-18 in Dayton, Ohio.First and second round games will take place from March 19-22 across eight different cities.The Final Four and National Championship will be held on April 4 and 6 in Indianapolis.The 2026 NCAA Tournament bracket was released on Selection Sunday evening.Vanderbilt and Tennessee were among 10 SEC teams in the field.March Madness begins with the First Four games on Tuesday and Wednesday, with first round NCAA Tournament games beginning Thursday at four sites. It will culminate on April 4 with the Final Four in Indianapolis.Keep tabs on this page for brackets, pairings and TV schedules for the 2026 NCAA Tournament. The NCAA Tournament selection show began at 5 p.m. CT. 2026 NCAA Tournament schedule for March MadnessAll times CentralEast Region (Washington D.C.)In Greenville, S.C. (Thursday)1-seed Duke (32-2) vs. 16-seed Siena (23-11), Approx. 1:50 p.m. CT on CBS8-seed Ohio State (21-12) vs. 9-seed TCU (22-11), 11:15 a.m. CT on CBSIn San Diego (Friday)5-seed St. John's (28-6) vs. 12-seed Northern Iowa (23-12), 6:10 p.m. CT on CBS4-seed Kansas (23-10) vs. 13-seed Cal Baptist (25-8), approx. 8:45 p.m. CT on CBSIn Buffalo (Thursday)6-seed Louisville (23-10) vs. 11-seed USF (25-8), 12:30 p.m. CT on TNT3-seed Michigan State (25-7) vs. 14-seed North Dakota State (27-7), approx. 3:05 p.m. CT on TNTIn Philadelphia (Friday)7-seed UCLA (23-11) vs. 10-seed UCF (21-11), 6:25 p.m. CT on TBS2-seed UConn (29-5) vs. 15-seed Furman (22-12), approx. 9 p.m. CT on TBSWest Region (San Jose)In San Diego (Friday)1-seed Arizona (32-2) vs. 16-seed LIU (24-10), 12:35 p.m. CT on TNT8-seed Villanova (24-8) vs. 9-seed Utah State (28-6), approx. 3:10 p.m. CT on TNTIn Portland (Thursday)5-seed Wisconsin (24-10) vs. 12-seed High Point (30-4), 12:50 p.m. CT on TBS4-seed Arkansas (26-8) vs. 13-seed Hawaii (24-8), approx. 3:25 p.m. CT on TBSIn Portland (Thursday)6-seed BYU (23-11) vs. 11-seed Texas-NC State First Four winner, 6:25 p.m. CT on TBS3-seed Gonzaga (30-3) vs. 14-seed Kennesaw State (21-13), approx. 9 p.m. CT on TBSIn St. Louis (Friday)7-seed Miami (FL) (25-8) vs. 10-seed Missouri (20-12), approx. 9:10 p.m. CT on truTV2-seed Purdue (27-8) vs. 15-seed Queens (21-13), 6:35 p.m. CT on truTVMidwest Region (Chicago)In Buffalo (Thursday)1-seed Michigan (31-3) vs. 16-seed UMBC/Howard First Four winner, 6:10 p.m. CT on CBS8-seed Georgia (22-10) vs. 9-seed Saint Louis (28-5), approx. 8:45 p.m. CT on CBSIn Tampa (Friday)5-seed Texas Tech (22-10) vs. 12-seed Akron (29-5), 11:40 a.m. CT on truTV4-seed Alabama (23-9) vs. 13-seed Hofstra (24-10), approx. 2:15 p.m. CT on truTVIn Philadelphia (Friday)6-seed Tennessee (22-11) vs. 11-seed Miami (OH)/SMU First Four winner, approx. 3:25 p.m. CT on TBS3-seed Virginia (29-5) vs. 14-seed Wright State (23-11), 12:50 p.m. CT on TBSIn St. Louis (Friday)7-seed Kentucky (21-13) vs. 10-seed Santa Clara (26-8), 11:15 a.m. CT on CBS2-seed Iowa State (27-7) vs. 15-seed Tennessee State (23-9), approx. 1:50 p.m. CT on CBSSouth Region (Houston)In Tampa (Friday)1-seed Florida (26-7) vs. 16-seed Prairie View A&M/Lehigh winner, approx. 8:25 p.m. CT on TNT8-seed Clemson (24-10) vs. 9-seed Iowa (21-12), 5:50 p.m. CT on TNTIn Oklahoma City (Thursday)5-seed Vanderbilt (26-8) vs. 12-seed McNeese (28-5), approx. 2:15 p.m. CT on truTV4-seed Nebraska (26-6) vs. 13-seed Troy (22-11), 11:40 a.m. CT on truTVIn Greenville, S.C. (Thursday)6-seed UNC (24-8) vs. 11-seed VCU (27-7), 5:50 p.m. CT on TNT3-seed Illinois (24-8) vs. 14-seed Penn (18-11), approx. 8:25 p.m. CT on TNTIn Oklahoma City (Thursday)7-seed Saint Mary's (27-5) vs. 10-seed Texas A&M (21-11), 6:35 p.m. CT on truTV2-seed Houston (28-5) vs. 15-seed Idaho (21-14), approx. 9:10 p.m. CT on truTV First Four gamesIn Dayton, OhioTuesday, March 17Midwest Region: 16-seed UMBC (24-8) vs. 16-seed Howard (23-10), 5:40 p.m. CT on truTVWest Region: 11-seed Texas (18-14) vs. 11-seed NC State (20-13), approx. 8:15 p.m. CT on truTVWednesday, March 18South Region: 16-seed Prairie View A&M (18-17) vs. 16-seed Lehigh (18-16), 5:40 p.m. CT on truTVMidwest Region: 11-seed Miami (OH) (31-1) vs. 11-seed SMU (20-13), approx. 8:15 p.m. CT on truTV First four out of NCAA TournamentThese were the first four teams left OUT of the NCAA Tournament:OklahomaAuburnSan Diego StateIndiana 2026 NCAA Tournament March Madness locations, sites, datesFirst FourMarch 17-18: Dayton, OhioFirst and second round gamesMarch 19 and 21: Buffalo, Greenville, Oklahoma City, PortlandMarch 20 and 22: Tampa, Philadelphia, San Diego, St. LouisSweet 16 and Elite EightMarch 26 and 28: Houston and San JoseMarch 27 and 29: Washington D.C. and ChicagoFinal Four and National ChampionshipApril 4 and 6: Lucas Oil Stadium, Indianapolis 2026 NCAA Tournament selection show start timeDate: Sunday, March 15Start time: 6 p.m. ET/5 p.m. CT",
